us icon on the bottom toolbar and navigate to the Templates tab to search for or find templates organized by category. You can also click the template icon in the top right corner to quickly browse through ready-made template options."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Explore Figma\u2019s online"," ",(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/",children:"template library"})," to view all of the free templates, from brainstorming and strategic planning to diagramming and meeting planning."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"57-what-are-some-popular-online-whiteboard-templates",children:"What are some popular online whiteboard templates?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"You can kickstart your ideas with hundreds of free online whiteboard templates. Some of the most popular ones include:"}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-kickoff-template/",children:"Project kickoff template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/flow-chart-template/",children:"Flowchart template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/team-meeting-agenda-template/",children:"Team meeting template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/customer-journey-map/",children:"Customer journey map template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/daily-stand-up-meeting-template/",children:"Standup template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-retrospective-template/",children:"Retrospective template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/agile-roadmap-template/",children:"Roadmap review template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/timeline-template/",children:"Project timeline template"})})]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"58-how-can-i-copy-a-flowchart-on-figjams-online-whiteboard",children:"How can I copy a flowchart on FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To copy a FigJam flowchart, drag your cursor around the entire flowchart, right-click, and then hit Group selection or Command + G on your keyboard. This will ensure your entire flowchart is grouped, making it easier to copy. Once you\u2019ve made your selection, click the flowchart and hit Command + C on your keyboard or right-click and hit Copy."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["If you want to copy individual objects or symbols on your flowchart, click the item you want to copy and hit Command + C on your keyboard, or right-click and hit Copy."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also make a copy of your flowchart for others to use by adding it to the"," ",(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/",children:"Figma Community"}),". To do this, click the Share button in the top right corner of your board, then click Publish to Community. You must have \u201CCan edit\u201D access to publish the file to the Community."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/360040035974-Publish-files-to-the-Community",children:"Learn more about how to publish files to the Figma Community"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"59-can-i-create-a-flowchart-with-specific-symbols-on-my-online-whiteboard",children:"Can I create a flowchart with specific symbols on my online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Absolutely! Flowchart symbols are shapes, lines, and arrows that represent actions or processes on your flowchart diagram. For example, a diamond shape symbolizes points where decisions are made, rectangles signify a specific action or step needed to carry out a process, and parallelograms show where users input or output data."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard has over 20 shapes and symbols you can use to build a flowchart that maps user flows, systems, and processes. Read FigJam\u2019s"," ",(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/flowchart-symbols/",children:"flowchart symbol guide"})," ","to learn more about what each symbol means and how to effectively use them."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"60-do-i-have-to-start-my-work-with-the-ready-made-online-flowchart",children:"Do I have to start my work with the ready-made online flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can start your flowchart with ready-made templates or start from scratch and build your own using shapes, lines, and connectors on the FigJam whiteboard. You can also use FigJam\u2019s Generate tool, which uses the power of AI to create a customized flowchart based on the prompt you input."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"61-can-i-add-sticky-notes-to-my-flowchart-board",children:"Can I add sticky notes to my flowchart board?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can add sticky notes anywhere on your board when building a flowchart. Press S on your keyboard or click the stack of stickies on the bottom toolbar, then click the area of your flowchart where you\u2019d like to drop the sticky."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also add connectors between sticky notes to visualize flows and create paths. Click the connector icon on the toolbar, or hit Shift + C to create an elbow connector or L for a straight line. Then, click and drag your cursor between the stickies you want to connect."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"62-can-i-add-text-to-my-flowchart",children:"Can I add text to my flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Shapes already come with the option to add text, making it easy to add text and labels when"," ",(0,s.jsx)(t2.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/how-to-create-a-flow-chart/",children:"building your flowchart"}),". When resizing a shape, use the text option in the toolbar to adjust the text or make any other formatting changes to enhance readability."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"63-can-i-undoredo-something-on-my-flowchart",children:"Can I undo/redo something on my flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Of course! To undo something on your flowchart, hit Command + Z on your keyboard. Or, navigate to the main menu in the upper left corner, click the Figma symbol, edit, and select undo. If you want to delete an object on your flowchart, hit the Delete button on your keyboard or right-click the flowchart object and hit Delete."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To redo something, click Shift + Command + Z on your keyboard or select edit, then redo on the main menu."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t6,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t8,id:"64-how-do-i-connect-shapes-and-symbols-on-my-flowchart-online",children:"How do I connect shapes and symbols on my flowchart online?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t5.k,{className:t7})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Use lines and connectors located on the bottom toolbar to connect shapes and symbols on your flowchart. Lines automatically snap ont